    "What would you like to connect? You can add more accounts later in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Womit möchtest du dich verbinden? Weitere Konten kannst du später in den Einstellungen hinzufügen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You find these details in your provider’s email under “Xtream Codes”. They are kept in the keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Daten findest du in der E-Mail deines Anbieters unter „Xtream Codes“. Sie werden im Schlüsselbund gesichert."
